      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\nalt_text_translate.py - Translate generated image descriptions\ndescribe_image.py - generates a short visual description for an image\ndetect_image_labels.py - detects labels or objects in a static image\ndetect_image_text.py - detects text appearing inside an image\nimage_asset_archive.py - Archive image-analysis artifacts and derived captions in managed object storage\nimage_summary.py - Summarize visual analysis results\nscore_image_safety.py - checks an image for unsafe or policy-sensitive visual content\nvision_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Static Image and Visual Understanding\nvision_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Static Image and Visual Understanding\nvisual_safety_text.py - Check generated visual labels for unsafe text\n\nCreate detect_image_labels.py in the current working directory.\nTask: detects labels or objects in a static image.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
